jobs.description:
In 2007, Bühler (Wuxi) Commercial Co., Ltd. was established in Wuxi, Jiangsu Province. We lead the market in grain handling and processing, consumer food manufacturing, and grinding and dispersion with our advanced technology advantages. We have several independent application centers and customer service centers for milling, pasta, color sorting, consumer food, grinding and dispersion, providing integrated solutions for multiple industry chains.<br/>With our vision of “Innovations for a better world”, we are committed to developing more innovative solutions by leveraging the global resources of the Bühler Group and taking advantage of localization.

Aufgaben:
• Equipment / BML List:Make motor and apparatus list according machine definition.

• Transfer BML list according HW design requirement. Clarify and check BML from mechanical / process.

• MCC Design:Concept design according process. Cabinet design / analyze with experience. Design circuit diagram based on BML list. Choose material according BML date. Layout design for MCC cabinet.

• Installation Design:Cable tray design according machine layout. Cable list for whole plant. Installation accessories summarize.

• MCC Testing / Check:Testing / Check cabinets on Group's manufacture factory or third supplier. Quality control for the cabinets.

• Site Installation Supervision:Work on site (China or other country) with mechanical & process engineer. Management and installation supervision for electrical team. IO testing independently using program tools. Interlocking testing with software engineer.

• Good relationship with customer.

Anforderungen:
• Bachelor degree or above, major in Automation;

• Above three years' work experience in MCC design or electrical installation on site

• Familiar with electrical engineering tools, such as Engineering Base, E-Plan, AutoCAD

• Familiar with Microsoft Office, especially Excel, Visio, Word;

• Familiar with electrical material, such as Schneider, Siemens, Wago;

• Basic knowledge for Siemens PLC software, such as Step 7;

• Good English speaking, reading and writing;

• Be team worker, leader, communicative, intelligent, balanced, technical;

• Effect communication skills, both written and verbal;

• Be Intelligent, willing to learn, work under pressure, behavior under pressure, Work-Life Balance;

• Proposal of alternative solutions, new ideas, and suggestions for improvement;

• Willing to travel.

20亿人每天食用布勒设备生产的食品。10亿人驾驶的车辆中包含本公司设备制造的部件。
布勒力求在每项决策中平衡兼顾人类、自然和经济，在全球食品、饲料和交通运输行业开发解决方案，拓展可持续业务解决方案。我们努力以创新驱动未来，特别专注于健康、安全、可持续的解决方案。因此，我们与客户、创业公司、跨国企业和学界携手
合作，共同加速实现影响。

